   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, cloud/review-1055-r2-opus, head 0b21f55fac9421247f9a03b01e2cbebd8e17e525): APPROVE** — round 2, posted verbatim\n\n**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, cloud/review-1055-r2-opus): APPROVE** — head 0b21f55f\n\nDelta review, round 2, of the LOT-041 and LOT-046 edits, plus a re-check of the whole PR diff.\n\nNo findings.\n\n- **LOT-041:27-28 matches the code.** `HFREndpoint+Search.swift:40-41` gives global search `RequestTimeout.globalSearch` plus `globalSearchTotal`, and `:68` gives topic search `RequestTimeout.topicSearch`. `HTTPRequest.swift:21-29` sets the presets: standard 10, topicSearch 10, globalSearch 10, globalSearchTotal 10, background 5.\n- **LOT-046:34 matches the code.** `GlobalSearchFlow.swift:93` passes the results GET `globalSearch` and `globalSearchTotal`, with `doNotFollow`.\n- **Links resolve.** `docs/lots/LOT-040-transport.md` exists.\n- **Stale values.** A grep of `docs/` and `Packages/HFRKit/Sources` for 15, 30 and 60 s turns up no current-state text that gives a standard, topic-search or global-search request its pre-#683 value. Two kinds of hit remain, and both are fine:\n  - Audit and research history (`docs/audit/*`, `REVIEW-fable.md`). These are dated records and should not change.\n  - Other values with their own source: Giphy 15 s, Rehost 60 s idle, the writes' 60 s (`PostingFlow.swift:228`, LOT-050) and AQ 20 s.\n- **GAP-750 still says \"30 s (HFRNetwork `RequestTimeout.standard`)\", and the author is right to leave it.**\n  - PR #1009 was merged at 2026-11-17T20:33Z. Its body has a `gap-edit` block for GAP-750 that replaces the cell with \"30 s (the reader's own wait limit, independent of the 10 s request idle limit since #683)\".\n  - That block has not been folded yet. `git log -S'GAP-750' origin/dev-swift -- docs` shows only #798. Later folds (#1031, #1032, #1034, #1047) do not include #1009, and #1009 has no `ledger: done` label.\n  - No `docs/ledger-*` PR is open.\n  - AGENTS.md §8 forbids this